<title>USA: JP Morgan wins $62 mln Fort Bend ISD, Texas.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan wins $62 mln Fort Bend ISD, Texas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities said it won $62 million of Fort Bend Independent School District, Texas, unlimited tax schoolhouse bonds, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.15564 percent.</p>
</text>
